ce, quality inspection\n- Transportation: autonomous driving perception, traffic optimization\n\n**Regulatory Landscape (2023‑2024)**\n- EU AI Act: tiered risk classification with compliance rules for high‑risk systems\n- US: NIST AI Risk Management Framework and bipartisan transparency legislation\n- China: "New Generation AI Development Plan" focusing on standards and ethics\n\n**Key Resources & Communities**\n- Journals: *Journal of Machine Learning Research*, *Artificial Intelligence*, IEEE TNNLS\n- Conferences: NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, CVPR, ACL, AAAI\n- Open‑source frameworks: TensorFlow, PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, JAX\n\n**Future Outlook**\n- Integration of large multimodal models with real‑time robotics and edge deployment\n- Strengthened trustworthy AI standards and international governance\n- Ongoing speculative research toward artificial general intelligence (AGI) with emphasis on scaling laws, alignment, and safety\n\nFeel free to let me know if you need a deeper dive into any specific area.\n\nBest regards,\nAI Research Assistant', 'subject': 'Summary of Artificial Intelligence Research', 'to': 'me@example.com'})
